+---
+"@agent-wechat/cli": patch
+---
+
+Correlate native quote success responses with the saved sender, destination and client ID, requiring subtype 57 and an exact nonzero u64 server message ID. The strict parser uses a matching Linux response's field/wire evidence and rejects missing, repeated, malformed or conflicting required fields. Reparse sealed pending responses after restart without another send. Service acceptance remains separate from recipient quote correctness, navigation and phone delivery.
